  "id": "the-cold-plunge",
  "title": "The Cold Plunge",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "This 4-part scripted series follows mail carriers in a fictional Alaskan town riddled by moose, which the residents believe are their ancestors. This belief was passed down for generations: jump through a hole in a frozen lake, and you too can become a moose. But some say it’s a lie. Some say that people are dying in that lake. Dying for nothing. Or worse. To hide a dark secret. Written and directed by Sunny Bleckinger, starring Kurt Conroyd, Sammy Rat Rios, Bruce Burkhartsmeier, Diane Kondrat, Claire Rigsby and Finley Vleer. Sound team includes Jeff Stuart Saltzman and Callie Day. Funded in part by a grant from the Regional Arts & Culture Council. If you enjoyed listening, please consider giving us a 5-star review, and share it with a friend. www.the-cold-plunge.com",
